(a) Granting incentives. The Council may grant other incentives, as provided by O.C.G.A. §§ 36-88-7 and 36-88-9, and as may be subsequently amended from time to time. Such incentives will be negotiated by the Mayor and Council on a case-by-case basis and may include, but not be limited to, exemptions from any or all of the following:
